        "n": "Alice Coltrane Special: Brandee Younger Live Performance (R)",
        "s": "2026-08-23T07:00:00+01:00",
        "e": "2026-08-23T07:30:00+01:00",
        "d": "Jazz harpist and Alice Coltrane acolyte Brandee Younger pays tribute to her hero with a live harp performance. Featuring Brandee Younger on harp and Rashaan Carter on double bass, recorded at Younger’s home studio in New York, NY.\n\"I specifically chose these three pieces for NTS Radio to pay tribute to the groundbreaking work of Alice Coltrane and Dorothy Ashby, while also integrating my own voice. The set reflects their profound influence on my music and the continued evolution of harp music, which remains a significant source of inspiration for my work today.\"",
        "j": "Brandee Younger Live Performance",
        "u": "https://www.nts.live/api/v2/shows/alice-coltrane-special-2025/episodes/alice-coltrane-special-2025-brandee-younger-live-performance-9th-february-2025",
